WEBVTT


00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:44.743
In this vast desert.


00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:48.272
many dynasties were established


00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:51.481
leaving behind countless legends.


00:00:52.152 --> 00:00:53.619
Over thousands of years,


00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:57.447
these dynasties rose and fell.


00:00:57.457 --> 00:01:01.090
All that remains is this desert.


00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:07.527
Beneath it lies a vast treasure


00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:11.800
hidden deep belowthe burning sand.


00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:15.798
No one can open the door to the treasure:


00:01:16.042 --> 00:01:19.243
it is protected by a group of secret guards.


00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:23.413
They have guarded this desert for generations


00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:26.048
The legend says only the leader of the guards


00:01:26.052 --> 00:01:29.219
can be called the "Eagle of the Desert"


00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:31.223
Every one of the guards


00:01:31.224 --> 00:01:34.459
is master of an oriental martial art.


00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:37.896
Every 2 decades, a new leader is selected.


00:01:37.897 --> 00:01:40.961
A new 'Eagle of the Desert'


00:02:25.912 --> 00:02:28.544
When a new leader is chosen,


00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:32.416
his opponent will be cast out.


00:02:32.819 --> 00:02:36.054
In the desert, power is everything


00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:39.017
Only the victor survives.


00:02:39.192 --> 00:02:42.723
No one remembers the loser


00:02:45.031 --> 00:02:47.706
For many years, countless explorers


00:02:47.851 --> 00:02:50.536
have come to this desert,


00:02:50.537 --> 00:02:53.670
hoping to find its great treasure.


00:02:53.907 --> 00:02:58.507
Few of them returned alive.


00:02:58.878 --> 00:03:01.180
What keeps the legend going


00:03:01.181 --> 00:03:04.973
is the "Eagle of the Desert"


00:03:10.757 --> 00:03:11.623
Hello?


00:03:11.624 --> 00:03:15.690
Miss Lan, you know the deadline has long passed?


00:03:15.728 --> 00:03:17.196
I don't care what happened to you


00:03:17.197 --> 00:03:19.798
3 days, You're allowed only 3 more days.


00:03:19.799 --> 00:03:21.033
This is an ultimatum.


00:03:21.034 --> 00:03:23.435
Chief editor, can I change the topic?


00:03:23.436 --> 00:03:26.330
I'm so fed up with these
explorations and tomb raiders


00:03:26.339 --> 00:03:29.631
Tell you what? I've a great idea for a romance...


00:03:29.842 --> 00:03:31.710
Who wants to read a romance?


00:03:31.711 --> 00:03:33.178
The readers of Qidian Chinese Literature Online


00:03:33.179 --> 00:03:36.281
are all waiting for the sequel to Ghost Town.


00:03:36.282 --> 00:03:38.116
Send me the draft in 3 days


00:03:38.117 --> 00:03:39.714
Otherwise you'll be fired!


00:03:41.588 --> 00:03:44.914
Fired? He's threatening me?


00:04:03.643 --> 00:04:06.378
Give me some more time, please
I've been writing.


00:04:06.379 --> 00:04:08.613
What happened? Being chased by the editor?


00:04:09.082 --> 00:04:10.212
Dad.


00:04:12.318 --> 00:04:14.820
Hey, you haven't come home for ages.


00:04:14.821 --> 00:04:17.487
Come have dinner with me tomorrow night.


00:04:18.324 --> 00:04:19.324
But I...


00:04:19.325 --> 00:04:21.684
So that's it I'll wait for you.


00:04:38.645 --> 00:04:40.379
Excuse me, please write, "To Pork Rib"


00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:43.205
P-O-R-K R-I-B
I was born in the year of pig.


00:04:44.851 --> 00:04:47.119
Thank you so much!


00:06:49.108 --> 00:06:51.740
Sir, what would you like to drink?


00:06:53.913 --> 00:06:57.444
We came here for business, not drinking.


00:06:57.683 --> 00:07:02.249
We heard that they never question
the provenance ofthe goods


00:07:04.157 --> 00:07:05.924
Therefore our master


00:07:05.925 --> 00:07:07.959
decided to send us here with these antiques


00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:11.229
We've travelled across all of Siberia.


00:07:12.165 --> 00:07:15.025
We hope you can offer us a good price


00:07:15.868 --> 00:07:19.501
As long as they're genuine,
I promise it'll be worth your while.


00:07:19.639 --> 00:07:22.203
Are you implying they're fakes?


00:07:35.822 --> 00:07:37.350
We'll see whether they're genuine or not


00:07:37.557 --> 00:07:40.592
when they're examined by our expert.


00:07:40.593 --> 00:07:42.087
Just wait here.


00:07:44.297 --> 00:07:46.565
He'll be here in a minute.


00:08:45.458 --> 00:08:47.350
So you're the expert?


00:08:47.426 --> 00:08:51.594
A Macedonian bronze...US$500,000


00:08:55.301 --> 00:08:59.332
A mediaeval gold sculpture! Cool!


00:09:00.706 --> 00:09:04.134
A Chinese bronze bell? Let me try.


00:09:04.911 --> 00:09:06.478
This is not for you,


00:09:06.479 --> 00:09:08.246
This is our master's alarm clock.


00:09:08.247 --> 00:09:11.380
It's only peaceful because he's asleep.


00:09:11.751 --> 00:09:13.852
If you strike the bell and wake him up,


00:09:13.853 --> 00:09:16.246
we'll be in trouble


00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:19.416
I see


00:09:21.394 --> 00:09:22.727
You stole it, right?


00:09:22.728 --> 00:09:26.691
No, my mom gave it to me.


00:09:27.533 --> 00:09:30.734
"My mom gave it to me"?
No matter, I'll confiscate it


00:09:31.103 --> 00:09:33.405
What? Confiscate it?


00:09:34.803 --> 00:09:36.575
You mean you're stealing it from me?


00:09:36.776 --> 00:09:38.236
Yes


00:10:33.299 --> 00:10:34.964
FYI, I'm not stealing them from you.


00:10:35.001 --> 00:10:37.269
I simply return them to where they belong.
Understand?


00:10:47.279 --> 00:10:48.380
Don't strike it!


00:10:48.381 --> 00:10:49.581
No...


00:10:49.582 --> 00:10:50.715
Don't strike it!


00:10:50.716 --> 00:10:51.783
Don't! Please don't.


00:10:51.784 --> 00:10:53.176
Don't!


00:10:58.190 --> 00:10:59.479
Run!


00:11:03.162 --> 00:11:04.622
Crazy people!


00:12:41.127 --> 00:12:42.587
Come on!


00:13:24.804 --> 00:13:27.839
I never get scared, I'll just kick your ass


00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:29.971
Tell me if it hurts, OK?


00:13:35.347 --> 00:13:37.080
It must be quite valuable


00:13:38.050 --> 00:13:39.800
Let me see,


00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:43.450
what we find today is...


00:13:44.623 --> 00:13:46.431
<i>People later discovered that</i>


00:13:46.623 --> 00:13:48.791
<i>in many ancient tombs</i>


00:13:49.295 --> 00:13:51.696
<i>there was nothing but a skeleton.</i>


00:13:51.697 --> 00:13:54.261
<i>Not even a single artifact</i>


00:13:54.266 --> 00:13:58.662
<i>Let me tell you,
this is called a "pauper's burial"</i>


00:13:59.905 --> 00:14:05.438
Master Hua,
I heard a batch of antiques just arrived


00:14:06.545 --> 00:14:10.648
Well...most of them are fake.


00:14:10.649 --> 00:14:15.579
According to historians.


00:14:16.088 --> 00:14:18.523
The most daring tomb raider in history...


00:14:18.524 --> 00:14:19.691
You bought a lot!


00:14:19.692 --> 00:14:21.892
Come on, he's giving things away again.


00:14:25.397 --> 00:14:27.824
Master Hua, have you made up your mind?


00:14:29.869 --> 00:14:31.469
Made up my mind? About what?


00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:33.037
The Lost City!


00:14:33.038 --> 00:14:35.306
I've found out who has the map


00:14:35.474 --> 00:14:37.332
Our dream is coming true!


00:14:39.612 --> 00:14:43.114
Pork Rib, how many times have I told you?


00:14:43.115 --> 00:14:45.617
The chance of coming out alive
from that place is very slim!


00:14:45.618 --> 00:14:49.786
Besides, I don't believe there is a genuine map.


00:14:49.989 --> 00:14:51.389
Yes, there is This one is genuine!


00:14:51.390 --> 00:14:54.250
Master Hua, you don't want to waste
your life away like this, right?


00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:57.222
If we can find that map,
everything will be settled!


00:14:57.630 --> 00:14:59.955
Do you remember last time? If...


00:15:02.902 --> 00:15:05.932
You're helping yourself not me!


00:15:07.373 --> 00:15:09.971
Pork Rib, are you afraid of dying?


00:15:10.142 --> 00:15:11.602
No, I'm not.


00:15:12.411 --> 00:15:14.269
Let me make it clear to you


00:15:15.314 --> 00:15:17.946
You're not afraid of dying,
but that doesn't mean you won't die


00:15:25.257 --> 00:15:26.751
Master Hua, you've finally agreed!


00:15:45.144 --> 00:15:48.504
Just hang in there a little longer.
We're nearly there


00:15:50.282 --> 00:15:51.742
This bag, take it


00:15:52.918 --> 00:15:54.742
This bag, take it


00:15:58.324 --> 00:15:59.490
Everything you retrieved


00:15:59.491 --> 00:16:01.782
has been returned to its country of origin.


00:16:03.195 --> 00:16:04.655
Here is a new case


00:16:06.065 --> 00:16:09.357
Qiaofei, look at this


00:16:15.074 --> 00:16:17.740
An ancient city lost in the 11th century


00:16:18.744 --> 00:16:20.534
Once upon a time, there was a king


00:16:20.813 --> 00:16:24.378
He had the largest glowing pearl in the world.


00:16:25.284 --> 00:16:28.246
The pearl was in the city


00:16:30.189 --> 00:16:33.390
When Genghis Khan was fighting towards the East.


00:16:34.326 --> 00:16:37.094
100 years later,
an old warrior came out of the city,


00:16:37.396 --> 00:16:39.009
He told someone


00:16:39.906 --> 00:16:42.929
this secret before he died


00:16:43.302 --> 00:16:45.467
The person was called the "Eagle of the Desert"


00:16:46.472 --> 00:16:50.508
He led a few hundred ancient warriors


00:16:50.509 --> 00:16:52.299
to guard the city


00:16:52.578 --> 00:16:56.245
I saw them protect the city with my own eyes


00:16:58.083 --> 00:17:03.082
It was at that moment that
I decided to go down this path.


00:17:03.389 --> 00:17:06.009
To return these treasures


00:17:06.809 --> 00:17:09.359
to where they came from.


00:17:12.464 --> 00:17:14.823
It's Lan Ting's birthday tomorrow.


00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:18.201
I've asked her to come over Come join us


00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:22.433
Are you sure?
She won't be happy to see me, will she?


00:17:23.409 --> 00:17:25.574
You're the one who won't be happy, aren't you?


00:17:27.079 --> 00:17:28.003
Looks like...


00:17:28.209 --> 00:17:32.373
I'm not the only one who
needs to patch things up with her


00:17:33.352 --> 00:17:37.144
Master Tu, please don't drag
me into your family business.


00:18:04.616 --> 00:18:06.110
Hello.


00:18:06.552 --> 00:18:09.184
Hey, can't you concentrate on the book?


00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:13.421
How can I? It's such trash!


00:18:14.293 --> 00:18:15.525
Then why are you reading it?


00:18:16.061 --> 00:18:18.522
Well... I treat it as a joke.


00:18:19.231 --> 00:18:21.692
Wait, it's not that bad, is it?


00:18:21.900 --> 00:18:25.067
It's not just bad but really bad.


00:18:25.137 --> 00:18:27.428
This book is full of crap!


00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:31.075
Full of prejudice against
archaeology and exploration


00:18:31.076 --> 00:18:33.177
Everyone is described as a greedy opportunist.


00:18:33.178 --> 00:18:35.646
This book of yours, I bet it won't sell


00:18:35.647 --> 00:18:38.015
You're still a nuisance.


00:18:38.016 --> 00:18:41.774
You're always big-headed and
you never respect other people


00:18:43.722 --> 00:18:46.957
Hey! Your dad wants you to go home for dinner


00:19:36.175 --> 00:19:37.575
You abandoned Mom and I


00:19:37.576 --> 00:19:39.935
for archaeology.


00:19:40.345 --> 00:19:42.169
Why did you come back?


00:19:42.314 --> 00:19:44.582
Why should I go back
just because you ask me to?


00:19:51.857 --> 00:19:54.819
Please follow the suggested route.


00:20:08.507 --> 00:20:09.967
Sit down


00:20:14.513 --> 00:20:17.407
Keep to the left and then turn right


00:20:42.174 --> 00:20:44.442
Chief, let's drink a toast to you!


00:20:49.848 --> 00:20:51.983
Chief, come on, another one


00:20:51.984 --> 00:20:53.945
I don't know what's wrong with him


00:20:54.152 --> 00:20:56.044
He couldn't live without meat before


00:20:56.221 --> 00:20:58.522
But now, meat scares the shit out of him.


00:20:58.523 --> 00:20:59.812
He must be possessed


00:21:00.659 --> 00:21:04.895
Master Hua, come eat something
You can't live on snacks


00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:09.694
Pork Rib,


00:21:11.303 --> 00:21:13.696
isn't it a bit too dangerous


00:21:14.172 --> 00:21:15.871
to abduct this girl?


00:21:16.675 --> 00:21:18.075
Well... you don't understand.


00:21:18.076 --> 00:21:20.378
Master Tu is really difficult.


00:21:20.379 --> 00:21:22.046
It took me so long


00:21:22.047 --> 00:21:23.748
to find his weakness


00:21:23.749 --> 00:21:25.778
It was his precious daughter!


00:21:25.817 --> 00:21:29.848
So, what are you going to do with her?


00:21:30.722 --> 00:21:33.820
No way! Are you falling for her?


00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:37.794
Well... I've got an idea.


00:21:37.829 --> 00:21:39.897
Anyway, when I get the map,


00:21:39.898 --> 00:21:43.167
I'll leave her to you Am I being fair enough?


00:23:57.135 --> 00:23:58.102
Hello?


00:23:58.103 --> 00:24:01.972
You thought I was joking?
I said 3 more days!


00:24:01.973 --> 00:24:03.774
I checked my email hundreds of times


00:24:03.775 --> 00:24:05.303
and not a single word there!


00:24:05.677 --> 00:24:08.673
I warn you, don't ever try to test my limits


00:24:09.281 --> 00:24:10.843
Are you listening to me?


00:24:12.617 --> 00:24:15.553
Miss Lan, I have a boss to report to...


00:24:15.554 --> 00:24:16.878
Anyone there?


00:24:17.556 --> 00:24:20.051
Let me ask you nicely, OK?


00:24:30.235 --> 00:24:31.968
I don't know where I am


00:24:34.639 --> 00:24:36.073
You've lost your memory?


00:24:36.074 --> 00:24:39.443
Call yourself a writer? What lame excuse is this?


00:24:39.444 --> 00:24:40.644
Why don't you say that you
don't know who you are?


00:24:40.645 --> 00:24:42.413
Bitch! Are you calling the police?


00:24:42.414 --> 00:24:43.447
What do you want?


00:24:43.448 --> 00:24:44.874
You shut up, baby!


00:24:45.050 --> 00:24:48.444
I want something from your dad,
so you're my hostage


00:24:49.521 --> 00:24:51.118
Then you took the wrong person


00:24:51.122 --> 00:24:52.514
The wrong person?


00:24:54.526 --> 00:24:57.127
You're the writer, right?


00:24:57.128 --> 00:24:58.796
I asked for your autograph
Do you remember?


00:24:58.797 --> 00:25:01.224
He wouldn't care about me.


00:25:01.800 --> 00:25:04.902
You're wrong I know he loves you very much.


00:25:04.903 --> 00:25:06.737
He'll definitely come to rescue you


00:25:06.738 --> 00:25:09.940
Chief, someone has arrived.


00:25:09.941 --> 00:25:10.841
How many?


00:25:10.842 --> 00:25:12.837
One, just one


00:25:26.858 --> 00:25:29.820
Who are you? You're not who we're looking for.


00:25:30.695 --> 00:25:32.292
I came here on behalf of Master Tu


00:25:32.998 --> 00:25:37.758
Who do you think you are?
Since Master Tu doesn't care,


00:25:37.969 --> 00:25:40.169
maybe we should just kill her


00:25:40.772 --> 00:25:43.836
If it wasn't for Master Tu,
you think I'd bother to come?


00:25:47.746 --> 00:25:51.038
Is this genuine?
I'm an expert, you can't fool me.


00:25:57.455 --> 00:25:59.017
Wait!


00:26:00.392 --> 00:26:04.287
If my dad wants to rescue me,
he should come himself.


00:26:04.996 --> 00:26:08.129
Stop fussing around!
What's the difference?


00:26:08.533 --> 00:26:12.325
It's different I won't leave until he comes.


00:26:12.571 --> 00:26:14.133
Your dad will never come.


00:26:15.507 --> 00:26:17.331
So what excuse does he have this time?


00:26:19.311 --> 00:26:22.478
He already died for the sake of this map.


00:26:24.983 --> 00:26:26.272
That's impossible


00:26:28.320 --> 00:26:29.780
Why are you lying to me?


00:26:30.655 --> 00:26:32.684
My dad even asked me to have dinner with him.


00:26:34.159 --> 00:26:37.223
No...that's impossible.


00:26:38.263 --> 00:26:42.397
You should count yourself lucky
that you didn't go home that night.


00:26:45.837 --> 00:26:47.071
Don't look at me like that


00:26:47.072 --> 00:26:49.473
I would never kill anyone.


00:26:49.474 --> 00:26:51.173
I don't kill!


00:26:51.209 --> 00:26:52.567
I'm a gentleman!


00:27:09.661 --> 00:27:11.595
If he had handed over the map sooner.


00:27:11.596 --> 00:27:14.490
Master Tu wouldn't have died.


00:27:15.667 --> 00:27:18.128
See? Told you I didn't do it!


00:27:18.670 --> 00:27:22.406
Everyone who has seen the map has to die!


00:27:22.407 --> 00:27:24.197
But I haven't!


00:27:29.447 --> 00:27:30.914
Take her upstairs, quick!


00:27:30.915 --> 00:27:33.149
Let's go!


00:30:12.844 --> 00:30:14.509
"The Sandstorm Legion"!


00:30:30.595 --> 00:30:33.393
I thought it was just a legend! It's true!


00:30:33.464 --> 00:30:35.664
Bonehead, Bonehead!


00:30:48.713 --> 00:30:50.447
Hey, that legion of something has come!


00:30:50.448 --> 00:30:51.976
Come on, let's go


00:30:58.189 --> 00:30:59.189
Run!


00:30:59.190 --> 00:31:00.787
I thought you didn't want to rescue me?


00:31:01.860 --> 00:31:03.457
Come on!


00:31:27.385 --> 00:31:28.879
Quick!


00:31:37.362 --> 00:31:38.754
Why did you push my bottom?


00:31:42.634 --> 00:31:43.800
I'm so scared!


00:31:43.801 --> 00:31:47.161
Why are you hugging me so tight?
You never did!


00:31:47.472 --> 00:31:50.070
What are you talking about? Go away!


00:31:50.308 --> 00:31:51.540
OK, see you


00:31:52.710 --> 00:31:54.136
Come back!


00:31:54.345 --> 00:31:55.805
What?


00:31:56.147 --> 00:31:57.744
Scary!


00:31:57.916 --> 00:31:59.808
No...I can't stand it


00:32:55.206 --> 00:32:57.269
Come on!


00:32:59.911 --> 00:33:01.371
Master Hua!


00:33:12.757 --> 00:33:13.757
What happened?


00:33:13.758 --> 00:33:15.355
We're finished!


00:34:33.905 --> 00:34:36.002
Master Hua, hurry! Lose them!


00:34:36.574 --> 00:34:38.034
Come on!


00:34:39.577 --> 00:34:42.446
Quick! There's dynamite in the box


00:34:42.447 --> 00:34:44.408
Take it out, quick!


00:34:44.949 --> 00:34:46.273
Hurry up!


00:35:15.246 --> 00:35:16.570
Blow them up!


00:35:43.007 --> 00:35:45.935
Qiaofei, look up ahead...


00:35:47.845 --> 00:35:49.112
Hold it.


00:35:50.014 --> 00:35:51.281
What for?


00:36:20.144 --> 00:36:22.639
Yes! We made it!


00:36:59.550 --> 00:37:01.078
What are you looking at?


00:37:05.823 --> 00:37:07.886
What's wrong with the chief this time?


00:37:08.559 --> 00:37:09.826
As soon as he woke up this morning,


00:37:09.827 --> 00:37:12.362
he ordered us to destroy all the
statues of gods in the square.


00:37:12.363 --> 00:37:15.899
He said he dreamt of being
chased by statues last night


00:37:15.900 --> 00:37:18.802
Chased by statues all night?


00:37:18.803 --> 00:37:20.837
Yes, in his dream


00:37:20.838 --> 00:37:23.868
He's been acting like this since he woke up.


00:37:27.278 --> 00:37:31.014
Little Feather, I thought you'd gone?


00:37:36.587 --> 00:37:39.422
Chief, I just wanted to know
what lay beyond this desert.


00:37:39.423 --> 00:37:42.317
Well... I never thought what lay outside
this desert was another desert.


00:37:42.493 --> 00:37:46.695
But, chief, it's still worth my efforts.
Here you are.


00:37:47.064 --> 00:37:48.298
What is this?


00:37:48.299 --> 00:37:51.334
I don't know.
But I saw many people fighting over it.


00:37:51.335 --> 00:37:53.500
So it must be something valuable


00:38:04.448 --> 00:38:08.616
It looks like the season of eagles has come.


00:38:48.492 --> 00:38:51.625
You still like lying on your
back looking at the sky


00:38:53.698 --> 00:38:58.094
Tears don't roll down your face
when you're staring at the sky


00:39:02.640 --> 00:39:04.032
I'll take you back tomorrow.


00:39:05.176 --> 00:39:09.936
I don't want to go back I want to stay


00:39:11.382 --> 00:39:16.085
I can never understand how someone could


00:39:18.489 --> 00:39:21.087
leave his wife and child for the desert.


00:39:23.461 --> 00:39:25.194
I can't understand it.


00:39:27.398 --> 00:39:30.895
I want to trace my father's steps.


00:39:31.502 --> 00:39:33.394
I think I can find the answer.


00:39:34.338 --> 00:39:35.662
No, you won't


00:39:36.574 --> 00:39:38.466
Haven't you caused enough trouble?


00:39:41.746 --> 00:39:44.844
My dad's dying wish is hidden in the map, right?


00:39:46.817 --> 00:39:48.516
Can we stop talking about it?


00:39:55.526 --> 00:39:58.795
Surprised to see a young guy
like you could fight so well


00:39:58.796 --> 00:40:01.189
You're a fierce rival Good to know that


00:40:01.499 --> 00:40:04.768
But I never thought the
"Sandstorm Legion" really existed


00:40:05.069 --> 00:40:06.803
Luckily I grew up in the desert.


00:40:06.804 --> 00:40:09.095
This is not a big deal to me


00:40:09.273 --> 00:40:11.808
So I see... you'll be fine if you follow me


00:40:11.809 --> 00:40:14.168
It's a pity that the map is gone


00:40:15.746 --> 00:40:17.946
But you don't look worried about it at all.


00:40:17.982 --> 00:40:20.079
Is the map fake?


00:40:20.451 --> 00:40:23.379
Who says it's fake?
I can get it back


00:40:24.287 --> 00:40:26.547
It's tagged!


00:40:26.657 --> 00:40:29.687
I knew it! You're as sly as me.


00:40:29.693 --> 00:40:32.495
Good, now we're in the same boat.


00:40:32.496 --> 00:40:36.132
We should help each other from now on


00:40:36.133 --> 00:40:37.934
If you need any help,
I'll definitely give you a hand


00:40:37.935 --> 00:40:39.402
See, after the map is put on the scene


00:40:39.403 --> 00:40:41.704
these mummies, horse riders, masked robbers


00:40:41.705 --> 00:40:43.540
and the legion of something have all appeared.


00:40:43.541 --> 00:40:45.642
Who knows what will show up later, right?


00:40:45.643 --> 00:40:47.377
Just give me a shout
My name is Pork Rib


00:40:47.378 --> 00:40:48.278
Have you finished yet?


00:40:48.279 --> 00:40:50.945
Almost. But if I need any help,
you'll have to help me as well.


00:40:50.981 --> 00:40:52.348
Let's be fair to each other


00:40:52.349 --> 00:40:53.650
So, that's it!


00:40:53.651 --> 00:40:57.821
Here, this will keep you warm
for the cold night.


00:40:57.822 --> 00:40:59.222
Give me a shout when you need help.


00:40:59.223 --> 00:41:00.512
Bye!


00:41:02.693 --> 00:41:04.392
Is something wrong with your friend?


00:41:05.396 --> 00:41:07.687
Nothing serious, he's just a little crazy


00:41:08.499 --> 00:41:11.666
So that's it Bye
Let me know if you need any help.


00:41:23.581 --> 00:41:25.109
Are you warm enough?


00:41:27.184 --> 00:41:28.712
Want some?


00:41:35.726 --> 00:41:38.722
Do you remember that I watched
you practice the piano?


00:41:39.797 --> 00:41:41.724
I crept up to the window.


00:41:41.765 --> 00:41:45.034
Your dad caught me and I was punished.


00:41:45.503 --> 00:41:47.634
Would you please stop talking about my dad?


00:41:53.844 --> 00:41:56.078
Alright, I'll stop.


00:41:56.647 --> 00:42:01.441
Here, try some That idiot gave it to us today


00:42:03.454 --> 00:42:07.315
Drink a bit, It'll make you feel better.


00:42:16.467 --> 00:42:18.758
He never cared about me.


00:42:21.872 --> 00:42:23.366
How could I care about you?


00:42:23.674 --> 00:42:25.373
I mean my dad


00:42:36.220 --> 00:42:37.714
You enjoy reading so much, right?


00:42:38.889 --> 00:42:40.383
You're such a nerd


00:42:42.326 --> 00:42:47.529
A nerd?
How dare you bring that up


00:42:47.865 --> 00:42:49.359
What?


00:42:54.838 --> 00:42:56.264
Now I remember...


00:42:56.473 --> 00:42:59.640
My first visit to a book shop,
I went with you


00:42:59.710 --> 00:43:04.709
And you vanished the day after
For 10 years.


00:43:06.083 --> 00:43:08.476
Was it because I called you a book thief?


00:43:14.525 --> 00:43:16.725
Why did you steal that book for me?


00:43:18.996 --> 00:43:21.662
Well, I guess I was young and I liked you.


00:43:25.603 --> 00:43:29.805
Liked me? In what way?


00:43:32.643 --> 00:43:34.137
As a friend.


00:43:40.551 --> 00:43:42.113
Otherwise, what do you think?


00:43:46.991 --> 00:43:50.593
Right, we could talk about anything as friends.


00:43:50.594 --> 00:43:53.124
Kind of brotherly love, right?


00:43:53.197 --> 00:43:54.862
You look really embarrassed


00:43:55.599 --> 00:43:57.196
A toast to you, brother.


00:44:05.209 --> 00:44:08.273
Keep drinking.
It's best if they both get drunk.


00:44:08.412 --> 00:44:10.407
Then I'll take the tracking device over


00:44:11.815 --> 00:44:14.083
Can you use it?


00:44:14.385 --> 00:44:17.820
Of course not!
Otherwise I wouldn't need you.


00:44:17.821 --> 00:44:22.182
Master Hua, as long as you're with me,
I don't need the map


00:44:26.497 --> 00:44:31.166
To be honest, if it weren't for you


00:44:32.269 --> 00:44:34.730
I would never be able to realize my dream


00:44:35.139 --> 00:44:39.535
This is the one and only time.


00:44:41.278 --> 00:44:42.636
I've pinned all my hopes on you.


00:45:19.216 --> 00:45:21.780
Master Hua, where are they?


00:45:23.353 --> 00:45:24.721
Where are those bloody kids?


00:45:24.722 --> 00:45:26.114
They're gone


00:45:26.623 --> 00:45:29.323
Damn it! They're so bloody rude!


00:45:41.438 --> 00:45:45.333
Stop wasting your time.
They drained the tank


00:46:12.536 --> 00:46:14.167
Where to, Master Hua?


00:46:14.538 --> 00:46:16.135
To the "Traveller's Village"


00:46:16.707 --> 00:46:17.907
"Traveller's Village"?


00:46:17.908 --> 00:46:20.143
Fantastic! The explorer's paradise.


00:46:20.144 --> 00:46:21.511
The meeting place for desert treasure hunters.


00:46:21.512 --> 00:46:23.575
You can buy anything
if you've got the money.


00:46:23.981 --> 00:46:25.182
Yes,


00:46:25.501 --> 00:46:29.552
it's a paradise and hell at the same time.


00:46:29.553 --> 00:46:32.688
If you're not strong enough,
you'll be destroyed by others


00:46:32.689 --> 00:46:34.991
You're just trying to scare me, right?


00:46:34.992 --> 00:46:37.351
You no good! You no good!


00:46:52.176 --> 00:46:54.068
Do I look good?
Yes


00:46:54.244 --> 00:46:56.239
Louder.
Yes


00:47:10.360 --> 00:47:12.218
Hey, you were really bad.


00:47:12.396 --> 00:47:13.462
What do you mean?


00:47:13.463 --> 00:47:15.798
They gave us the drink and you drained their tank


00:47:15.799 --> 00:47:17.166
What will happen to them?


00:47:17.167 --> 00:47:20.459
You feel sorry for them?
Why don't you go with them?


00:47:21.505 --> 00:47:22.805
You're really nasty!


00:47:22.806 --> 00:47:24.232
I don't think so.


00:47:32.316 --> 00:47:33.616
The map is nearby


00:47:33.617 --> 00:47:35.077
The map?


00:47:41.358 --> 00:47:43.182
Hey, kid Stop!


00:47:45.162 --> 00:47:46.656
Stop!


00:47:48.398 --> 00:47:49.765
Stop! Come here.


00:47:49.766 --> 00:47:52.330
Get out of my way!


00:48:03.647 --> 00:48:07.178
Chief, they're so daring.
They're chasing me!


00:48:15.325 --> 00:48:17.149
Aren't you tired, kid?


00:48:18.095 --> 00:48:19.521
What?


00:48:27.638 --> 00:48:29.769
You no good! You no good!


00:48:30.641 --> 00:48:33.239
Chief, look how arrogant he is!


00:48:35.279 --> 00:48:36.773
So what?


00:48:48.292 --> 00:48:49.957
Out, all of you.

